WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:07.360
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going&nbsp;
to explain a South Korean fantasy comedy film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:15.920
called “The Dude in Me.” Spoilers&nbsp;
ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:22.400
The protagonist of the film is the heir of the&nbsp;
Hanho group and a well-known elite gangster,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:28.080
Pan-soo. In the beginning, we are introduced to&nbsp;
his lavish lifestyle and loveless marriage to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:33.840
Seo Yeon. Pan-soo only married her because her&nbsp;
father Mr. Han is the President of the Hanho&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:40.320
group and an influential man. Seo Yeon is rich&nbsp;
and spoiled and hasn’t worked a day in her life&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:45.440
but she still feels entitled to her husband and&nbsp;
father’s money. She complains that her father is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:50.480
refusing to buy her a gallery that she really&nbsp;
wanted. Pan-soo ignores her ridiculous demand&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:55.840
and goes on about his day. In the office, he&nbsp;
is informed of a carpenter who is refusing to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.840 --> 00:01:01.760
evacuate his shop that needs to be destroyed for&nbsp;
Pan-soo’s next project. To get the job done, he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:08.240
invites his right-hand man Mr. Bang and asks him&nbsp;
to get the carpenter out, one way or the other.
&nbsp;

00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:13.840
Meanwhile, the carpenter, Jong-ki is nervous,&nbsp;
knowing that the thugs will use force to make&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:19.040
him evacuate. His fears become reality when&nbsp;
Mr. Bang comes to his shop and threatens to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:24.160
cut his arm off if he doesn’t sign the papers.&nbsp;
With no way out, the poor man gives up his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:24.551
shop. In the following scene, we are introduced&nbsp;
to Pan-soo’s business rival Mr. Yang. The two meet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.551 --> 00:01:24.648
at a restaurant and get into an argument about&nbsp;
business. It is evident that Yang is only looking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.648 --> 00:01:26.160
for the right opportunity to murder Pan-soo and&nbsp;
take over his business. The next day, Pan-soo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:30.880
decides to go to an old ramen shop that used&nbsp;
to be his favorite restaurant back in the day.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.880 --> 00:01:37.040
Alongside him, a high school student Dong-Hyun is&nbsp;
also enjoying the noodles. Dong-Hyun tries to pay&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:41.840
but finds out that he forgot his wallet.&nbsp;
When he apologizes to the restaurant’s owner,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:46.480
she forgives him and claims that Pan-soo&nbsp;
will pay for him out of generosity.
&nbsp;

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:51.280
The gangster is outraged by the bold&nbsp;
lady but doesn’t mind paying for the kid,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:56.400
even though he ate four bowls of ramen. The&nbsp;
shop owner promises to give him a special gift&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.400 --> 00:02:01.840
in turn for his generosity. A while later,&nbsp;
Dong-Hyun is on the edge of a two-story building,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.840 --> 00:02:07.440
trying to retrieve a shoe from a pole. As he tries&nbsp;
to reach for it, he loses his balance and falls&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:13.680
on top of Pan-soo who happens to be standing right&nbsp;
below. When Pan-soo opens his eyes again, he finds&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:20.160
himself on a hospital bed. A young nurse calls him&nbsp;
a student and talks to him informally. Confused,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:26.400
he walks outside and is horrified to see his body&nbsp;
lying down on another hospital bed. Before he can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:33.120
react, the carpenter Jong-ki launches at him,&nbsp;
calling him his son. A confused Pan-soo looks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:38.160
into the mirror to finally realize that he has&nbsp;
swapped bodies with the shy kid from earlier.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.880 --> 00:02:46.800
Coincidentally, Jong-ki, who he threatened to&nbsp;
kill the previous day, is Dong-Hyun's father. 
&nbsp;

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:51.280
When Pan-soo acts differently than his normal&nbsp;
self and refuses to recognize his father,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:56.800
the doctor declares that he has something called&nbsp;
Retrograde Amnesia. Pan-soo then recollects what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.800 --> 00:03:02.240
the restaurant owner told him earlier and runs to&nbsp;
meet her again. However, by then, the restaurant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:11.920
is being closed and the woman is nowhere to be&nbsp;
found. Meanwhile, his rival Yang hears the news&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:17.280
about him being in a coma. He is over the moon&nbsp;
and plans to take advantage of the situation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:23.600
to kill Pan-soo. At night, Pan-soo returns home&nbsp;
to his wife who thinks he is an intruder. He tries&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:28.880
to explain the situation but Seo Yeon calls the&nbsp;
security and makes them kick him out of the house.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:37.120
He is then taken to the police station and&nbsp;
accused of trespassing. His poor father is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:42.800
distressed because of his outrageous behavior.&nbsp;
Thankfully for him, the police let Pan-soo free&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:48.320
without much fuss because he is underaged. 
In the following scene, Pan-soo tries to wake up&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:48.320 --> 00:03:53.440
his body that is in a coma. Desperate to get&nbsp;
his body back, he jumps on top of Dong-Hyun.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:58.720
Just then, his right-hand man Mr. Bang enters&nbsp;
the room and stops him. Pan-soo tries to make&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.720 --> 00:04:04.000
him understand that he is trapped in a kid’s body&nbsp;
but Bang thinks he is bluffing and kicks him out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:09.360
of the room. After being disrespected by his&nbsp;
employees, Pan-soo returns to Dong-Hyun’s home&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:15.120
with his father. The place is too small for his&nbsp;
liking but he has a hundred more problems to tend&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:21.040
to. Jong-ki cooks him a plethora of dishes to&nbsp;
accelerate his recovery. Initially, Pan-soo says&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:26.000
that he doesn’t eat like a glutton but a while&nbsp;
later, the plates are all empty. He realizes that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:31.120
even though his mind is different, he is still in&nbsp;
Dong-Hyun’s body which affects his appetite. 
&nbsp;

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:35.920
Jong-ki believes that Dong-Hyun was bullied into&nbsp;
waking on the edge of the building which resulted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:41.040
in the accident. The next day, he goes to meet his&nbsp;
school principal. When asked about bullying, the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:46.240
principal claims that nothing of such sort happens&nbsp;
in their school. Pan-soo sees through his lies&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:51.280
and is determined to find out what exactly caused&nbsp;
the accident. As soon as he enters the classroom,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:51.280 --> 00:04:56.880
a group of boys make fun of him and flip him off.&nbsp;
Pan-soo instantly registers that Dong-Hyun was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:56.880 --> 00:05:04.960
an introvert who was made fun of all the time.&nbsp;
During the lunch break, a girl named Hyun-jung&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:04.960 --> 00:05:09.920
is also being bullied by popular kids. They&nbsp;
mix her food with a cold drink and make her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:14.960
eat it. Eventually, they dump the entire plate&nbsp;
of food on her. Pan-soo calls them out for it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:20.160
angering the leader of the bullies, Tae Wook. 
Before Pan-soo can showcase his fighting skills,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:26.000
the teachers arrive and Tae Wook has to retreat.&nbsp;
After school, the bullies stop Pan-soo again&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:31.440
and try to intimidate him. In turn, he slaps&nbsp;
them all with zero effort and simply walks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:36.240
away. Later that day, the bullies trouble&nbsp;
another guy in the washroom. Just then,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:36.240 --> 00:05:41.440
Pan-soo comes out from a stall and helps the&nbsp;
poor guy. He also takes Tae Wook’s phone away,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:46.080
promising to return it the next day. The bullies&nbsp;
are so scared that they let him do whatever he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:51.520
wants. While going through the phone, Pan-soo&nbsp;
sees a video of the day the accident took place.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:56.800
It is revealed that Tae Wook and his group had&nbsp;
bullied Dong-Hyun into getting on the edge.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:56.800 --> 00:06:01.200
They are the reason he fell off the&nbsp;
bundling and their bodies exchanged.
&nbsp;

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:05.840
The next day, Tae Wook’s leader is beating&nbsp;
him up for giving Pan-soo his phone that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:11.120
has the video on it. Pan-soo arrives and kindly&nbsp;
asks the leader to never trouble anyone again,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:16.480
blackmailing him with the video. The bully&nbsp;
has no way but to agree. Somewhere else,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:21.680
Pan-soo’s wife Seo Yeon takes advantage of her&nbsp;
husband’s comatose state and starts dating younger&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:27.920
men. Pan-soo’s rival, Mr. Yang gets a hint of this&nbsp;
and blackmails her into joining hands with him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:33.520
The two, together plan Pan-soo’s downfall. 
That night, Pan-soo goes to the hospital and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:33.520 --> 00:06:39.280
meets Mr. Bang. He tells Bang everything about his&nbsp;
past and proves his identity. The following day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:39.280 --> 00:06:44.320
Hyun-jung bumps into him and drops her stuffed&nbsp;
toy. He follows her behind to return it and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:44.320 --> 00:06:51.200
happens to meet her mother, Mi-Sun. To Pan-soo’s&nbsp;
utter shock, Mi-Sun is his first love who he left&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:57.200
to marry his current wife. He calls her by her&nbsp;
first name which surprises Mi-Sun. After Pan-soo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:57.200 --> 00:07:03.040
runs away, he remembers how he and Mi-Sun used to&nbsp;
spend their days together when they were young.
&nbsp;

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:08.720
When he meets Hyun-jung the next time, he takes&nbsp;
some of her hair to use for a parental DNA test.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:14.400
The results come out and Pan-soo finds out&nbsp;
that Hyun-jung is actually his daughter.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:20.000
Following that, he goes to meet Mi-Sun and subtly&nbsp;
asks her about her life. She tells him that she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:25.920
raised Hyun-jung all on her own because her father&nbsp;
was not a good person. Pan-soo feels awful that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:31.040
the people he loves had to go through so much&nbsp;
because of his absence. Somewhere else, his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:37.120
current wife Seo Yeon goes to her father with fake&nbsp;
reports of Pan-soo misusing the company’s money.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:42.560
In reality, she was told to do so by Pan-soo’s&nbsp;
rival Mr. Yang. Her father believes her and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:46.960
starts to consider removing Pan-soo from the&nbsp;
company once he gets out of the coma. 
&nbsp;

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:50.960
Somewhere else, Pan-soo goes to a gym&nbsp;
to lose weight and to get closer to his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:50.960 --> 00:07:58.080
daughter who is learning self-defense in the&nbsp;
same institution. Initially, she is skeptical&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:03.360
and is about to leave but Mr. Bang pretends to&nbsp;
be the instructor and convinces her to stay.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:03.360 --> 00:08:08.480
Starting that day, the father and daughter train&nbsp;
together and begin getting along well. Eventually,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:13.920
Pan-soo loses weight and gets fit. The girls in&nbsp;
the school, including the bullies, are surprised&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:13.920 --> 00:08:19.120
by his new persona. During the lunch break,&nbsp;
Hyun-jung’s bullies stop her again. But this time,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:24.320
she teaches them a lesson and defends herself&nbsp;
efficiently. The other students are stunned to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:24.320 --> 00:08:29.600
witness her newfound confidence. That evening,&nbsp;
Pan-soo goes to Mi-Sun’s restaurant again.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:35.120
While talking, she mentions her former lover&nbsp;
who she wishes she should have killed. Pan-soo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:35.120 --> 00:08:41.120
realizes she is talking about him and chokes on&nbsp;
water. Mi-Sun is helping a perverted customer when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:47.520
he touches her inappropriately. An enraged Pan-soo&nbsp;
asks her to go inside and fights the perverts.
&nbsp;

00:08:47.520 --> 00:08:52.640
Mi-Sun suddenly stops him, inquiring why he&nbsp;
is acting out of character. Pan-soo sits her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:57.840
down and finally tells her everything about&nbsp;
switching bodies with Dong-Hyun. Initially,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:57.840 --> 00:09:02.000
she doesn’t believe him but Pan-soo challenges&nbsp;
her to ask him anything that he would know.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:07.520
When he answers all the questions correctly,&nbsp;
Mi-Sun is in shock. Still, she asks him to go&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:14.000
away from their lives as he did all those years&nbsp;
ago. A flashback shows us young Mi-Sun and Pan-soo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:18.800
meeting for the last time. He rudely informed her&nbsp;
that he was getting married to his boss’s daughter&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:24.720
and asked Mi-Sun to forget him. The following day,&nbsp;
a popular guy from the school named Minho invites&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:30.160
Hyun-jung to his birthday party. Hyun-jung, who&nbsp;
has never been called to a party, excitedly agrees&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:30.160 --> 00:09:35.680
to come, unaware of Minho’s actual intentions.&nbsp;
After that, Pan-soo and Mi-Sun meet at a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:40.640
restaurant where she bluntly tells him that she&nbsp;
doesn’t want him in their lives. He tries to win&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:45.600
her over and kisses her in front of everyone. The&nbsp;
people around them are shocked because to them,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:50.080
Pan-soo is half of Mi-Sun’s age.
She pushes him away and slaps him in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:55.840
face. Still, Pan-soo doesn’t stop and follows her&nbsp;
outside. Suddenly, he gets a call from his friend&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:55.840 --> 00:10:00.880
who informs him about the bullies’ plan to trouble&nbsp;
Hyun-jung at the party. Pan-soo quickly rushes to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:06.640
the party and arrives there to see Minho pouring&nbsp;
a bowl of alcohol on Hyun-jung. Angered to see his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:06.640 --> 00:10:11.760
daughter crying, he fights all of the guys who are&nbsp;
surrounding her. The girls who witness the fight&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:17.680
fall head over heels for him. Hyun-jung also takes&nbsp;
a stand against Minho and kicks him into the pool.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:23.040
After that, the father and daughter leave. The&nbsp;
following day, Mr. Bang informs Pan-soo that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:27.120
his wife is conspiring to remove him&nbsp;
from Hanho's list of potential heirs.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:32.480
Pan-soo writes a letter to his father-in-law Mr.&nbsp;
Han and asks Mr. Bang to deliver it to him. 
&nbsp;

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:37.440
Later that day, Pan-soo is walking down the street&nbsp;
when one of the girls from his class asks him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:43.040
out. He claims that he doesn’t date schoolgirls.&nbsp;
Right after, Hyun-jung arrives and asks him the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:50.000
same question. Horrified, Pan-soo tells her that&nbsp;
he can never date her and walks away. At home,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:54.640
Mi-Sun also finds out that her daughter wants&nbsp;
to date her father. She orders Hyun-jung to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:54.640 --> 00:11:00.320
stay away from him. At night, Pan-soo’s rival&nbsp;
Yang breaks into the hospital to kill Dong-Hyun.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:00.320 --> 00:11:06.960
Just as he is about to do so, Dong-Hyun wakes up&nbsp;
out of the blue. Startled, Yang runs away. After&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:06.960 --> 00:11:12.000
waking from the coma, Dong-Hyun finds himself&nbsp;
in a strange body and runs to his father.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:17.760
Jong-ki thinks he is an intruder and is about&nbsp;
to call the police when Pan-soo returns home. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:22.320
explains everything to Jong-ki who is still&nbsp;
skeptical but agrees to believe them. 
&nbsp;

00:11:24.720 --> 00:11:30.160
Following that, Pan-soo asks for Dong-Hyun’s&nbsp;
help to solve things with Mi-Sun. The two go&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:35.600
to her restaurant and pretend to have returned&nbsp;
to their own bodies. As Dong-Hyun apologizes to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:40.320
her as Pan-soo, Yang and his men come to the&nbsp;
restaurant. He had followed Dong-Hyun from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:40.320 --> 00:11:46.080
the hospital and is here to kill him once and for&nbsp;
all. Dong-Hyun cries, begging them for his life,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:50.640
surprising Yang and his group. Pan-soo&nbsp;
sends Mi-Sun and Dong-Hyun to another&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:57.040
room and fights the thugs. But this time, they&nbsp;
have come prepared for his attacks. Suddenly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:57.040 --> 00:12:02.160
Mi-Sun comes out and opens a gas cylinder,&nbsp;
threatening to blow up the entire place. Yang&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:07.360
and his men have no choice but to run away.
Because of the chaos, Mi-Sun finds out that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:12.240
the guys were lying earlier. Still, she&nbsp;
talks to Dong-Hyun as Pan-soo and tells&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:12.240 --> 00:12:17.200
him about the hardships she faced because&nbsp;
of his absence. The two hug in the end. 
&nbsp;

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:21.440
Somewhere else, Mr. Han has found out that his&nbsp;
daughter lied to get her husband in trouble&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:27.200
and hide the fact that she has an extramarital&nbsp;
affair. Han disowns her and refuses to give her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:32.240
an inheritance. He also asks Pan-soo to&nbsp;
meet him instantly. Since Pan-soo cannot&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:32.240 --> 00:12:37.200
go in front of them himself, Dong-Hyun goes&nbsp;
in his place with a microchip in his ears.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:37.200 --> 00:12:42.160
The chip works fine for a few minutes but when&nbsp;
Han asks him about his second family, it turns&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:48.560
off. With no one to communicate to, Dong-Hyun is&nbsp;
alone to make Pan-soo decisions for him. He says&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:48.560 --> 00:12:52.960
that after returning from the hospital, he has&nbsp;
realized that family is the most important thing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:58.320
in the world. Hence, he is removing himself&nbsp;
from the Hanho group to be with his family.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:58.320 --> 00:13:02.560
Han respects his decision and lets him go.
When Dong-Hyun returns to the car,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:07.600
Pan-soo hugs him, thanking him for doing the&nbsp;
right thing. But their happiness doesn’t last&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:13.280
long when an enraged Seo Yeon hits them with&nbsp;
her car. Pan-soo is severely injured and has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:13.280 --> 00:13:18.400
to be taken to the hospital. As he is talking&nbsp;
to his family on his deathbed, Dong-Hyun falls&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:23.680
unconscious. In the following scene, Pan-soo is&nbsp;
in an operation theater. His surgeon is the same&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:23.680 --> 00:13:30.160
woman who caused the body swap. She asks him if he&nbsp;
liked the gift and changes him back to normal. 
&nbsp;

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:34.080
Six months later, Dong-Hyun, in&nbsp;
his own body, returns to school.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:42.640
Everyone respects him and is nice to him. He&nbsp;
and Hyun-jung have started dating. Meanwhile,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:42.640 --> 00:13:48.320
Pan-soo has bought a better place for Mi-Sun to&nbsp;
run her restaurant. All of them, including Jong-ki&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:48.320 --> 00:13:53.440
and Mr. Bang, work for her as employees.  
